<title>SWITZERLAND: UBS sees dividend for 1996 unchanged.</title>
<headline>UBS sees dividend for 1996 unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland chief executive Mathis Cabiallavetta said the bank would pay an unchanged dividend to shareholders on 1996 results despite a projected loss due to restructuring.</p>
<p>&quot;Despite the loss, which will be reported, our shareholders will receive an unchanged dividend,&quot; Cabiallavetta said in the text of a speech released before a news conference.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial</p>
</text>
